System dependencies
-------------------

MediaRip dynamically links to GTK 4 (LGPL-2.1-or-later), GdkPixbuf
(LGPL-2.1-or-later), libdvdread (GPL-2.0-or-later), and libbluray
(LGPL-2.1-only). It invokes separately installed FFmpeg/FFprobe, cdparanoia,
cd-info, lsblk, udevadm, and eject programs. These components are not bundled
in the MediaRip repository or executable. Distributors that bundle them must
include the licence and corresponding-source material required by the exact
versions and builds they distribute. FFmpeg's effective licence depends on
its build configuration.

